    <li><strong>Implementation Plan: Todo API &amp; DB-driven Master Plan sync</strong> — <a href="[% c.uri_for('/Documentation/ImplementationPlanTodoAPIAndMasterPlanSync') %]\">/Documentation/ImplementationPlanTodoAPIAndMasterPlanSync</a> (REST API + auto-synced master plan).</li>
